[node name="RoomN" type="Node2D"]
editor_description = "Enemies playground (Stage 8), scrolls sideways. 1) A wisp patrols between the left wall and a low block: gust it into the block (wall slam = 2 s stun) and dash into it while it's dizzy. 2) A wisp patrols a platform over a spike pit: gust it off into the spikes. 3) A sentry at the far end fires orbs when it sees you (eye glows orange just before): gust an orb back at it to destroy it. Hide behind the low block to break its line of sight. Dying or R brings every enemy back."
